.TH DRAW_RECT_OUTLINE 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
draw_rect_outline \- One\-pixel outline of r, in logical pixels (so it scales up with the window)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqdraw.h\(dq
.BI "void draw_rect_outline(Rect r, Color c);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
One\-pixel outline of r, in logical pixels (so it scales up with the window). Handy for selection boxes and for seeing hitboxes; for the latter prefer debug_rect(), which only shows with the F3 overlay.
.SH MODULE
draw (src/engine/draw/draw.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR draw_rect (3),
.BR debug_rect (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
